# ============================================
# IMPORTANT: For Vercel deployment, you MUST:
# 1. Create a free Neon database at https://neon.tech
# 2. Replace the DATABASE_URL below with your Neon connection string
# 3. Add these same variables in Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables
